kunzite: Adreno 710 steps 8-9, read-only GPU SMMU (kgpu=8/9; 1-7 unchanged).
8: qsmmu-v500 0x3da0000 (FDT, qcom,skip-init): layout from IDR0/IDR1 checked against the FDT size,
IDR2/IDR7/sCR0/sGFSR, then SMR/S2CR and CBAR/CBA2R of the first 6 only (qcom,num-smr-override /
num-context-banks-override = 6: the rest are not HLOS's), and where streams 0 (GPU), 2 (secure),
5 (GMU) are matched. 9: context 0 (kgsl's GPU context) and, if different, the HLOS context
stream 0 goes to: SCTLR, ACTLR, TTBR0, TCR, MAIR0, FSR, FAR. Needs CX + SMMU clocks (steps 4-5,
still undone at the end).

